Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Har salesman ke liye personal target dashboard hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.18,0:00:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ek circular progress bar dikhta hai — current achievement percentage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.48,0:00:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Green matlab on-track, yellow slightly behind, red matlab critical push chaahiye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.52,0:00:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Neeche month-wise breakdown — April se abhi tak har month kitna kiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.82,0:00:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Bhi dikhta hai — remaining amount, aur remaining days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.19,0:00:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Simple math — daily kitna achieve karna hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.93,0:00:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeh ek motivation tool hai — daily open kariye, apne progress ko dekhiye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.48,0:00:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Chhote goals set kariye, monthly target automatic ban jaayega.
